TAM PLAN INDEX

Command 0.53.0 integrates the shared bundle startup barrier. Delivery follows
the public bundle plan
<https://github.com/greenermoose/tamlinux-tools/blob/develop/docs/plans/tam-bundle.md>.

Reviewed 2026-10-27 (current work and branch handoff) under the plan
maintenance procedure <../plan-maintenance.md>. This is the complete inventory
of plans and corpus notes in this directory. Read status/disposition before a
historical body. A closed plan is not a task queue. ROADMAP.md gives priority;
development.md gives the current contract.


